---
description: Data handling and privacy rules, especially L3 pastor data
globs: ["**/*"]
alwaysApply: true
---
- Classify data: PUBLIC (L1 content), COMMUNITY (L2 responses — anonymous), PRIVATE (L3 check-ins, pastor profiles).
- PRIVATE data: encrypted at rest, access-logged, never sent unmasked to a third-party model,
  never sent to external observability in raw form, deletable on request.
- L2 responses are collected anonymously; do not store IP or account id alongside response text.
- Seed/demo data is synthetic. Never use real pastor data in development or demos.
- Scripture/source texts: only public-domain or properly licensed translations (see docs/data-ethics.md).
